          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-nosql-integration/#cassandra-aware-data-partitioning">Cassandra-aware data partitioning</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">The connector creates Spark partitions aligned to Cassandra's token ranges, so each task reads from a single set of co-located replicas.</span></li>
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-nosql-integration/#cassandra-write-consistency-levels">Cassandra write consistency levels</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Controls how many replicas must acknowledge a write (ONE, QUORUM, ALL) before it's considered successful, trading latency against durability.</span></li>
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-nosql-integration/#cluster-aware-read-optimization-for-cassandra">Cluster-aware read optimization for Cassandra</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Reads are routed to the replica nodes holding each token range, minimizing cross-node network hops during a full-table scan.</span></li>
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-nosql-integration/#mongodb-bson-format-handling">MongoDB BSON format handling</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">The MongoDB Spark Connector converts BSON documents to Spark's Row/schema representation, inferring or accepting an explicit schema for nested fields.</span></li>
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-nosql-integration/#mongodb-aggregation-pipeline-integration">MongoDB aggregation pipeline integration</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Aggregation pipeline stages can be pushed down to MongoDB before data reaches Spark, reducing the volume pulled across the wire.</span></li>
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-nosql-integration/#mongodb-write-concern-management">MongoDB write concern management</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Controls acknowledgment level for writes back to MongoDB (e.g. w:1, majority), balancing write latency against durability guarantees.</span></li>
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-nosql-integration/#schema-and-type-conversion-across-nosql-stores">Schema and type conversion across NoSQL stores</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Flexible NoSQL document/wide-column types must be reconciled with Spark's strict schema — handling type mismatches, missing fields, and nested structures.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
