          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-3-technologies/batch-processing/spark-metastore-catalog/#aws-glue-data-catalog-usage">AWS Glue Data Catalog usage</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">A managed, Hive-metastore-compatible catalog on AWS shared across Spark, Athena, and Redshift Spectrum for a single source of table metadata.</span></li>
